```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Service
    participant Controller
    participant ErrorHandler as Error Handler Middleware
    participant Logger as Pino Logger
    participant Client

    Service->>Service: throw new BadRequestError("Invalid input")
    Service-->>Controller: Error Thrown
    
    Controller->>Controller: catch (error)
    Controller->>Controller: Check Error Type
    
    alt WebError Instance
        Controller-->>ErrorHandler: Pass Error
    else Unknown Error
        Controller->>Controller: Wrap in WebError<br/>statusCode: 500
        Controller-->>ErrorHandler: Pass Wrapped Error
    end
    
    ErrorHandler->>ErrorHandler: Extract Error Details<br/>statusCode, message, details
    ErrorHandler->>Logger: Log Error<br/>{ level, message, error, requestId }
    Logger-->>ErrorHandler: Logged
    
    ErrorHandler->>ErrorHandler: Format Error Response<br/>{ error: { message, code?, details? } }
    ErrorHandler-->>Client: HTTP Response<br/>statusCode + Error Object
```
